  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan weighs killing a righteous path Gu Immortal and replacing that person, he discards the plan because forces use methods such as life tablet Gu, soul lantern Gu, or blood rope Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1214
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "gu_soul_lantern_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Every super force and normal force has an ancestral hall. Inside, life tablet Gu and soul lantern Gu are used, or even blood rope Gu. The first two are common. Even small and big sects in Central Continent keep buildings like an ancestral hall that store life tablet Gu and soul lantern Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1342
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ancestral-halls-and-other-holdings",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "reg_central_continent"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In Spirit Affinity House, a secret room holds a wall of jade-like small tablets. First supreme elder names them life tablet Gu, each carrying the name of a past fairy of the house from the first generation onward, and says Zhao Lian Yun’s life tablet Gu is already at the lowest position when she becomes the current generation fairy.",
        "chapters": [
          1229
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ancestral-halls-and-other-holdings",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_spirit_affinity_house",
          "char_zhao_lian_yun"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Murong Qing Si’s life tablet Gu and soul lantern Gu shatter inside her immortal aperture, those two Gu are the tokens she and Yun Liang had given each other.",
        "chapters": [
          1444
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ancestral-halls-and-other-holdings",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_murong_qing_si",
          "char_yun_liang"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Thousand Transformations Ancestor is told that Fairy Cui Bo’s life tablet Gu has broken and her soul lantern Gu has turned dim after she went to translocation desert, and that she can no longer be contacted.",
        "chapters": [
          1398
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fairy-cui-bos-tokens-break",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_thousand_transformations_ancestor",
          "char_fairy_cui_bo"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Thousand Transformations Ancestor treats the report as Fairy Cui Bo being in trouble rather than dead, and transmits an order to his concubine Hong Yun to set off, find her and save her. He lends Hong Yun a rank eight Immortal Gu along with his will and immortal essence, and stays inside his palace himself so that his weakened state is not exposed.",
        "chapters": [
          1399
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "hong-yun-sent-after-the-tokens-break",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fairy_cui_bo",
          "char_dancer_hong_yun",
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
